OL,3,W"###"###"###T//-,.,,-,.-/.-//,,.,.,.-//
OL,4,CPolice officer guilty of raping woman  
OL,5,GA police officer has been convicted of 
OL,6,Grape and controlling and coercive      
OL,7,Gbehaviour.                             
OL,9,FAvon and Somerset PC Stephen Phipps    
OL,10,Fwas found guilty of the two offences   
OL,11,Fand acquitted of two further offences  
OL,12,Fof rape and sexual assault by a jury   
OL,13,Fat Exeter Crown Court earlier.         
OL,15,FThe 45-year-old, of Bridgwater in      
OL,16,FSomerset, was arrested and immediately 
OL,17,Fsuspended after the victim reported    
OL,18,Fthe offences in February 2023. The     
OL,19,Fforce also referred itself to the      
OL,20,FIndependent Office for Police Conduct. 
OL,22,                                   G1/4 
