OL,4,CTribute to 'much-loved' teen killed in 
OL,5,Ccrash                                  
OL,6,GTributes have been paid to a "much-    
OL,7,Gloved" teenager who died in a crash.   
OL,9,FConnor Bradley, 17, from Porthleven,   
OL,10,FCornwall, died in a car that crashed   
OL,11,Finto a building on Sunday.             
OL,13,FHis father Stephen Bradley said: "We   
OL,14,Fare absolutely devastated and          
OL,15,Fheartbroken at the loss of Connor."    
OL,17,FDevon and Cornwall Police said it was  
OL,18,Fcontinuing to appeal for information   
OL,19,Fabout the crash, which happened on the 
OL,20,FA39, near Truro, and left three other  
OL,21,Fteenagers injured.                     
OL,22,                                   G2/4 
