OL,4,CMum's fatal BBL an accident - but risk 
OL,5,Cof more deaths                         
OL,6,GA mother-of-five's death has been      
OL,7,Gruled an accident after she suffered   
OL,8,Gfatal injuries from being given seven  
OL,9,Gtimes the recommended filler during a  
OL,10,Gcosmetic procedure.                    
OL,12,FAlice Webb, 33, collapsed at a         
OL,13,Ffriend's house in Gloucester on 23     
OL,14,FSeptember 2024 and died the following  
OL,15,Fday after a liquid Brazilian butt lift 
OL,16,F(BBL).                                 
OL,22,                                   G3/4 
