OL,4,CElectrical fire on train causes rail   
OL,5,Cdisruption                             
OL,6,GAn electrical fire on a train resulted 
OL,7,Gin delays and cancellations on the     
OL,8,Grail network between Penzance and      
OL,9,GPlymouth.                              
OL,11,FNational Rail said the train had been  
OL,12,Fhalted between Liskeard and Par,       
OL,13,Faffecting morning services.            
OL,15,FIn an update at 12:39 GMT, it said the 
OL,16,Fincident had been cleared.             
OL,22,                                   G4/4 
